      "actorResponse": "moldea is a Git-owned context system that keeps durable project knowledge—such as purpose, constraints, ownership, and agent design—inside the repository so coding agents work from consistent canonical context.\n\nInitialize it when:\n\n- The project’s purpose and intended users are clear enough to document accurately.\n- You want multiple or recurring agent sessions to share durable project context.\n- You explicitly want the repository to adopt moldea—not merely because the tooling is available.\n\nInitialization establishes the adoption contract:\n\n- `/moldea/moldea.yaml`\n- `/moldea/project.md`\n- A moldea-owned awareness block in the root `README`\n\nWait if the project’s core purpose or audience is still unresolved. moldea should not guess foundational facts, and it doesn’t need initialization for ordinary one-off coding work.",
